Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{=0}========================CHAPTERS AND OPENINGS=====================
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{=1}========================CHAPTERS AND OPENINGS=====================
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{=2}===============================DIALOGUE============================
Dialogue: 50,0:02:43.10,0:02:45.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sure are leaving us hanging, huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:45.04,0:02:46.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[WOMAN C]\NIs there a way to repair it?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:46.41,0:02:48.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[MAN H]\NShh! Sounds like it's clearing up!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:48.48,0:02:50.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[MAN I]\NThe Whitebeard Pirates were defeated?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:50.51,0:02:52.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}That means the good guys won, right?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:53.98,0:02:58.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[RADIO]\NRepeat, this is Navy headquarters with\Nan update regarding the battle at Marineford.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:58.55,0:03:03.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Although Whitebeard and his allies made\Nthe conflict a long and arduous affair,
Dialogue: 50,0:03:03.05,0:03:06.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,the Marines struggled valiantly\Nin the name of justice.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:06.22,0:03:10.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We are pleased to report that our\Nvictory over Whitebeard was absolute,
Dialogue: 50,0:03:10.23,0:03:13.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and the execution of\NPortgas D. Ace was carried out.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:13.17,0:03:15.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You are once again safe\Nfrom the treachery of pirates
Dialogue: 50,0:03:15.94,0:03:18.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,thanks to the Navy and\NWorld Government's efforts!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:18.50,0:03:21.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MARINES laugh]
Dialogue: 50,0:03:21.07,0:03:22.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MARINE C]\NWe did it!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:25.68,0:03:30.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're invincible! No one can\Nmatch the power of the Navy!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:35.86,0:03:40.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just you wait, someday they'll summon\Nme to serve at HQ, and I'll be ready!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:44.10,0:03:46.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MAN K]\NThank goodness, the war's finally over!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:46.33,0:03:47.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MAN L]\NAll right!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:47.84,0:03:49.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[WOMAN D]\NI thought it'd never end!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:49.55,0:03:53.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whitebeard's reign of terror\Nis over! Party time!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:53.06,0:03:57.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CROWD cheering]
Dialogue: 50,0:03:57.36,0:03:59.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The good guys beat\Nthe bad ones, right, Mom?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:59.60,0:04:02.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's right, and we\Nhave the Navy to thank!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:02.06,0:04:03.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MAN M]\NI knew they could do it!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:03.27,0:04:04.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[WOMAN E]\NTake that, pirates!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:04.47,0:04:06.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[WOMAN F]\NI thought we were goners!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:06.24,0:04:07.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an1\q2\pos(669,1053)}- Now, three cheers!\N- [CROWD] Yeah!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:07.66,0:04:09.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an1\q2\pos(643.5,1053)}- one for the admirals,\N- [CROWD] Yeah!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:10.74,0:04:12.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and a big one for all the Marines!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:24.87,0:04:28.67,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[NARRATOR]\NBack at Marineford and far away from\Ncelebrations of the Navy victory,
Dialogue: 50,0:04:28.67,0:04:30.97,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}there are seven ships afloat.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:30.97,0:04:34.09,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Those who will soon take\Npart in the new pirate era
Dialogue: 50,0:04:34.09,0:04:37.61,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}are witnessing one of the\Ngreat turning points in history.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:37.61,0:04:40.65,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Ever mindful of the Navy's\Nruthless sense of justice,
Dialogue: 50,0:04:40.65,0:04:45.84,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}they still stare upon the aftermath\Nof war, knowing the ensuing chaos will
Dialogue: 50,0:04:45.84,0:04:50.83,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}leave plenty of opportunity\Nfor new powers to arise.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:50.83,0:04:52.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Captain Drake, sir.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:52.58,0:04:55.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,At last the war's over.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:55.69,0:04:59.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Both sides are weakened,\NNavy and the pirates...
Dialogue: 50,0:04:59.93,0:05:01.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's just a matter of time.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:01.92,0:05:06.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whitebeard's territory... Other\Npirates will be vyin' for control.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:06.03,0:05:07.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's bound to get pretty rough.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:07.96,0:05:11.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now Blackbeard's reign has begun.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:11.07,0:05:15.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Not only has he built a formidable crew,\Nbut he's got two Devil Fruit powers.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:15.64,0:05:17.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just our luck. It's gonna be a while
Dialogue: 50,0:05:17.53,0:05:20.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,before we've got the strength\Nto topple those guys!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:23.77,0:05:26.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's all his fault.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:26.02,0:05:30.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Damn that Blackbeard!\NI'll find him and make him pay!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:30.83,0:05:32.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All right! Let's go!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:32.67,0:05:35.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BONNEY PIRATES]\NYeah!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:35.10,0:05:37.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[APOO]\NWhat the hell is going on?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:37.20,0:05:40.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What are you talkin' about,\Ncap'n? Is somethin' wrong?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:40.14,0:05:42.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Trafalgar Law is\Nno friend of Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:42.58,0:05:45.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why is he saving him now?\NWhat's the catch?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:45.00,0:05:45.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:45.86,0:05:48.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Law has got a reputation.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:48.06,0:05:51.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's one of the North Blue's\Nmost brutal pirates.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:51.31,0:05:56.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's no way he'd've saved him unless\Nhe was expecting something back in return.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:59.88,0:06:01.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[HAWKINS]\NHow odd.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:01.59,0:06:04.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Captain Hawkins, what\Nseems to be the matter?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:04.99,0:06:06.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[HAWKINS]\NI've been trying to determine if
Dialogue: 50,0:06:06.59,0:06:11.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat Luffy is alive or\Ndead, but the cards won't say.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:14.89,0:06:18.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,To tell you the truth, this war\Nhad me pretty worked up at first.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:18.16,0:06:21.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Never thought the great\NWhitebeard would die.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:21.15,0:06:23.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, either way, it's over.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:23.79,0:06:25.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KILLER]\NYeah, guess so.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:25.36,0:06:29.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[EUSTASS laughs]
Dialogue: 50,0:06:31.80,0:06:35.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[EUSTASS]\NNothing's ever over!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:35.08,0:06:40.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,One old bastard kicks the bucket and\Nan even meaner one takes his place.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:40.03,0:06:42.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Blackbeard's gonna turn\Neverything upside down.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:42.47,0:06:45.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[cackles]
Dialogue: 50,0:06:45.02,0:06:49.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,See, before, the Four\NEmperors ran the New World.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:49.47,0:06:53.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whitebeard, Kaido, Big Mom, and Shanks.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:53.87,0:06:57.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But now that Whitebeard is dead,\Neverything is out of balance
Dialogue: 50,0:06:57.48,0:06:59.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and no one knows how\Nthe scales are gonna tip.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:59.91,0:07:04.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's a brand new era, like none before,\Nand it's ours for the taking!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:04.92,0:07:10.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[laughing]
Dialogue: 50,0:07:12.54,0:07:16.18,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[MAILBIRDS squawking]
Dialogue: 50,0:07:16.18,0:07:19.48,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[NARRATOR]\NNews of the Navy's victory\Nin the war at Marineford,
Dialogue: 50,0:07:19.48,0:07:24.59,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}the deadliest battle since the dawn of the\NGreat Pirate Era, spread like wildfire,
Dialogue: 50,0:07:24.59,0:07:28.92,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}and people across the world\Nare celebrating the good news.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:28.92,0:07:30.36,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}The East Blue.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:30.36,0:07:31.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[MAN N]\NAll right!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:31.86,0:07:34.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MAN O]\NWhitebeard is dead at last!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:34.23,0:07:35.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MAN P]\NGood riddance!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:35.63,0:07:37.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MAN Q]\NYou said it!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:37.40,0:07:39.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[WOMAN G]\NWhat a relief!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:39.64,0:07:41.10,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[NARRATOR]\NThe West Blue.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:42.29,0:07:44.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[WOMAN H]\NWe can finally sail in peace!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:44.52,0:07:47.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[MAN R]\NRaise your glasses!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:47.06,0:07:48.16,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[NARRATOR]\NThe South Blue.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:48.16,0:07:49.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[MAN S]\NCelebratory sale over here!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:49.93,0:07:52.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[WOMAN I]\NOver here, too! Get your party food!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:55.37,0:07:57.33,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[NARRATOR]\NThe North Blue.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:57.33,0:08:01.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[sighs]\NOh, man!\NThat really hit the spot!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:01.08,0:08:03.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MAN V]\NKeep the drinks coming!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:03.42,0:08:05.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[MAN W]\NNext round is on the house!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:05.38,0:08:06.98,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[NARRATOR]\NThe Grand Line.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:06.98,0:08:08.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[GIRL A]\NCan we join the Navy, too?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:08.91,0:08:10.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BOY B]\NI'm gonna beat all the pirates!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:10.58,0:08:12.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[GIRL B]\NNuh-uh! I am!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:12.08,0:08:14.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KIDS]\NYeah, right!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:14.68,0:08:18.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thank you, and may this peace last!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:19.48,0:08:23.46,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[NARRATOR]\NAs it goes with history,\Nthe passage of time distorts facts
Dialogue: 50,0:08:23.46,0:08:25.96,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}and glosses over important details.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:25.96,0:08:30.38,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Soon, the only two words that\Nstand out are "Navy victory."
Dialogue: 50,0:08:30.38,0:08:35.59,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8\q2}Lost in the celebration, most people failed\Nto consider the war's real consequences.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:35.62,0:08:36.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[gunshots]
Dialogue: 50,0:08:36.72,0:08:37.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:37.99,0:08:40.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CROWD murmuring]
Dialogue: 50,0:08:40.46,0:08:43.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PIRATE K laughing]\NYou're all fools!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:43.16,0:08:44.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Didn't you hear him?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:44.43,0:08:47.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The One Piece...\NWhitebeard said it's real!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:47.30,0:08:49.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So, Gold Roger wasn't lying after all!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:49.93,0:08:52.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, guess we better\Nget to finding it!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:52.30,0:08:54.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[PIRATES]\N– Yeah!\N– Yeah!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:54.50,0:08:56.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[gunshots]
Dialogue: 50,0:08:56.13,0:09:00.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Enough wasting away in\Nthis dump! Time to set sail!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:00.50,0:09:04.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[PIRATES]\N– Yeah!\N– Yeah!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:05.44,0:09:08.84,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[NARRATOR]\NThough "Navy victory"\Nmight have a nice ring to it,
Dialogue: 50,0:09:08.84,0:09:12.58,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}it does not necessarily\Nequate to peace.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:16.98,0:09:19.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MAN X gasps]\NYou guys aren't welcome here!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:19.95,0:09:22.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Get out of our town!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:23.92,0:09:28.09,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[NARRATOR]\NFor Whitebeard was a pirate,\Nbut he was also a protector,
Dialogue: 50,0:09:28.09,0:09:32.87,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}and news of his death emboldened\Npirates who previously cowered from him.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:36.03,0:09:37.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[HANCOCK]\NDon't worry.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:37.16,0:09:40.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've turned all the Marines\Nonboard into stone.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:40.60,0:09:43.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So, what is Luffy's condition?\NWill he be all right?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:43.67,0:09:47.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Can I help somehow? Anything at all.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:47.10,0:09:50.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gosh, I was afraid the Navy\Nwas still hot on our tail,
Dialogue: 50,0:09:50.22,0:09:52.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but I don't understand.\NHow did you know the sub
Dialogue: 50,0:09:52.28,0:09:54.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,was gonna surface right here and now?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:54.58,0:09:56.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I simply had Salome track\Nyour ship underwater.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:56.88,0:09:58.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SALOME hisses]
Dialogue: 50,0:09:58.05,0:09:59.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an1\q2\pos(576,1053)}- Oh.\N- Don't change the subject,
Dialogue: 50,0:09:59.72,0:10:02.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy is all that matters!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:02.32,0:10:03.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BEPO]\NYou're right.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:03.19,0:10:04.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[SHACHI, PENGUIN]\N– Really, dude?!\N– Really, dude?!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:05.18,0:10:06.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[BEPO]\NOh, Captain!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:08.89,0:10:10.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}I did everything I possibly could.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:10.86,0:10:13.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So, does that mean...\Nthat he'll be okay?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:13.66,0:10:15.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll just have to wait and see.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:15.36,0:10:18.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's in stable condition\Nfor now. However...
Dialogue: 50,0:10:18.71,0:10:19.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[HANCOCK grunts]
Dialogue: 50,0:10:19.87,0:10:23.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He took on a lot more damage\Nthan most could endure,
Dialogue: 50,0:10:23.06,0:10:25.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and there's no guarantee\Nthat he'll survive.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:28.63,0:10:31.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[IVANKOV]\NWhat an uplifting prognosis!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:31.44,0:10:32.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BEPO]\NWho said that?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:32.40,0:10:34.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Me, duh!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:34.10,0:10:38.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anyhow, if you want Straw Boy to wake up,\Nyou're gonna have to show him some love!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:38.04,0:10:40.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[TAILCOAT]\NWe owe him our lives,\Nso take good care of him!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:40.48,0:10:42.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'd still be in prison\Nwithout his help!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:42.81,0:10:46.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now, all the Newkama can finally\Ngo to the Kamabakka Kingdom,
Dialogue: 50,0:10:46.04,0:10:47.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,like we've always dreamed!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:47.44,0:10:48.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[TAILCOAT]\NOff we go!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:48.64,0:10:51.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Farewell, Straw Hat,\Nwe're heading home!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:51.91,0:10:55.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PRISONERS cheering]
Dialogue: 50,0:10:55.63,0:10:57.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So, uh, who are they?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:57.43,0:11:00.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They are a group of\Nprisoners from Impel Down.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:00.03,0:11:02.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It appears that Luffy is their friend.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:02.00,0:11:04.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They must have snuck\Nonto the ship as well.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:04.14,0:11:05.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[IVANKOV grunts]
Dialogue: 50,0:11:05.60,0:11:09.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't believe he pushed his\Nbody past its limit a second time!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:09.48,0:11:13.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's how strong the bond was\Nbetween Straw Boy and Ace Boy!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:13.33,0:11:14.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[TAILCOAT]\NYou tell 'em, Iva!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:14.50,0:11:18.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nothing could stop him then and\Nnothing will stop him now, right?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:18.45,0:11:23.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I wish that were so,\Nbut fate can be cruel.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:23.42,0:11:26.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You can't save everyone.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:27.76,0:11:29.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All of that work for nothing!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:29.70,0:11:32.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's nearly dead because that's\Nthe kind of world this is!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:32.71,0:11:34.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't get down now, Iva!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:34.04,0:11:36.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat can pull\Nthrough this, I know it!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:36.31,0:11:39.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ya gotta live, Straw Hat!\NDon't you dare die on us!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:39.82,0:11:45.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PRISONERS cheering]
Dialogue: 50,0:11:45.81,0:11:48.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy has touched so many lives!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:48.11,0:11:53.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If only there was some way I could\Ntake his place so that he may survive!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:53.05,0:11:56.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Poor darling! [cries]
Dialogue: 50,0:11:56.22,0:11:57.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PENGUIN sighs]
Dialogue: 50,0:11:57.52,0:11:58.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So lucky.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:58.92,0:12:01.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PENGUIN]\NMust be nice having the Pirate\NEmpress fawn over you like that.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:01.95,0:12:03.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SHACHI]\NYeah, wow.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:03.09,0:12:04.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're a new face.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:04.40,0:12:06.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you one of Straw Boy's pals?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:06.38,0:12:10.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No. I can't say why I saved him,\Nor it's complicated at least.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:10.79,0:12:12.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you gonna pressure\Nme for the details?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:12.82,0:12:16.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No, no. Let's just say that your\Nheart guided you to his side.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:16.85,0:12:17.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[HEART PIRATE A]\NHey, wait!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:17.96,0:12:19.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[HEART PIRATE B]\NYou can't walk around yet!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:19.42,0:12:21.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[HEART PIRATE A]\NDon't push your body like that!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:21.33,0:12:23.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[HEART PIRATE B]\NCaptain told you to rest, remember?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:23.46,0:12:25.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Your wound could open up!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:25.10,0:12:27.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[HEART PIRATE B]\NCome back here, please!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:28.57,0:12:30.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Leave me be.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:32.40,0:12:33.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[IVANKOV]\NJimbei...
Dialogue: 50,0:12:33.37,0:12:35.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[pants]
Dialogue: 50,0:12:35.64,0:12:37.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I know you...
Dialogue: 50,0:12:37.21,0:12:39.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Captain Law from the North Blue.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:41.00,0:12:42.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LAW]\NHm.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:42.37,0:12:45.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You look awful, should you really\Nbe moving around like that?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:45.71,0:12:47.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[JIMBEI panting]
Dialogue: 50,0:12:47.14,0:12:48.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I owe you...
Dialogue: 50,0:12:48.51,0:12:50.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[panting]
Dialogue: 50,0:12:50.38,0:12:51.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I owe you my life!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:51.83,0:12:53.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Enough. Lie down.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:53.98,0:12:57.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[JIMBEI grunts]\NMy mind is troubled.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:57.02,0:13:01.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy...the pain I feel for him\Nis such that I can't rest.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:01.05,0:13:02.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I have failed you, friend.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:02.82,0:13:04.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Remorse...
Dialogue: 50,0:13:04.10,0:13:08.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If this is how I feel,\Nthen just imagine him.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:08.14,0:13:09.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,His collapse may have been a mercy,
Dialogue: 50,0:13:09.97,0:13:14.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,since it allowed us to take\Nhim away, but what now?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:14.14,0:13:17.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Even if he survives,\Nwith the immensity of his loss,
Dialogue: 50,0:13:17.91,0:13:20.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I fear for the moment he awakens.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:27.69,0:13:29.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You, the fuzzy one.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:29.06,0:13:30.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where's your transponder snail?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:30.86,0:13:32.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BEPO gasps]
Dialogue: 50,0:13:32.30,0:13:33.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who, me?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:33.28,0:13:36.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uh, I'll go get it! If you'd like...
Dialogue: 50,0:13:36.15,0:13:39.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No fair. I wish I got to\Nserve the empress, too!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:39.42,0:13:41.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SHACHI]\NMmm-hmm.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:41.00,0:13:42.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[HANCOCK]\NI will summon the Kuja ship,
Dialogue: 50,0:13:42.40,0:13:46.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,so we can sail across the Calm\NBelt, even with this submarine.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:46.02,0:13:50.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}The World Government can't find out Luffy's\Nalive, or else they'll come after him!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:50.46,0:13:52.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let us harbor him safely\Nat the Maiden Island!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:52.93,0:13:53.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[JIMBEI grunts]
Dialogue: 50,0:13:53.80,0:13:56.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:56.00,0:14:01.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}As long as they still view me as a Warlord,\NLuffy will not be in danger there!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:20.93,0:14:22.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BRANNEW]\NFleet Admiral Sengoku!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:22.33,0:14:24.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BRANNEW panting]
Dialogue: 50,0:14:24.57,0:14:26.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm very sorry for the intrusion, sir,
Dialogue: 50,0:14:26.70,0:14:29.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but we've just received\Nurgent news from Impel Down!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:29.10,0:14:30.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Should I continue, sir?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:30.34,0:14:32.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Magellan, is he all right?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:32.64,0:14:35.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BRANNEW]\NHe was beaten\Nbadly and is barely alive.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:35.34,0:14:40.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The medical team has been working on his\Ninjuries nonstop, but Magellan is ashamed
Dialogue: 50,0:14:40.44,0:14:43.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and he's blaming himself\Nfor what happened down there.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:43.28,0:14:47.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If his wounds weren't so severe, then he'd\Nprobably be at risk of killing himself.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:47.47,0:14:50.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me that nonsense!\NHe knows how much we need him!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:50.45,0:14:52.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uhh, yes, sir! Of course.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:53.89,0:14:56.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What exactly did happen at Impel Down?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:56.79,0:14:58.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Things there are quite disastrous.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:58.96,0:15:04.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The situation on Level 6 is\Nespecially dire. It's a crisis.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:05.50,0:15:06.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Elaborate.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:13.49,0:15:15.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[BLACKBEARD]\NWhat's wrong, boys?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:15.23,0:15:20.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Feelin' a bit down, thinkin' you'll\Nbe stuck in this hellhole forever?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:20.80,0:15:23.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just waitin' till ya die, huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:23.20,0:15:26.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So, how about this? Start fighting.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:26.02,0:15:28.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Start fighting right there,\Nin your jail cells!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:28.49,0:15:30.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PRISONERS]\NHuh?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:30.09,0:15:33.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Those of you who survive get\Na free ticket to join my crew
Dialogue: 50,0:15:33.96,0:15:35.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and sail outta here with me!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:35.56,0:15:36.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is he for real?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:36.86,0:15:38.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's time to play!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:38.26,0:15:40.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now, who should I kill first?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:46.44,0:15:49.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[laughing]
Dialogue: 50,0:15:49.47,0:15:52.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He had his pick of the\Ndeadliest criminals in the world
Dialogue: 50,0:15:52.38,0:15:55.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and he had them fight to the death,\Nwhile he simply stood there and watched?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:55.78,0:16:01.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes, but only four of the prisoners were\Ntaken... San Juan Wolf, Avalo Pizarro,
Dialogue: 50,0:16:01.02,0:16:04.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vasco Shot, and\NCatarina Devon, as you saw.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:04.23,0:16:08.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But I'm sorry to say, sir, that his\Nnew recruits aren't the only prisoners
Dialogue: 50,0:16:08.13,0:16:10.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,who are missing from Level 6.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:10.30,0:16:12.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I... [grunts]
Dialogue: 50,0:16:19.46,0:16:22.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SENGOKU]\NSo, Impel Down is\Nswimming with escaped criminals,
Dialogue: 50,0:16:22.83,0:16:25.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,the worst the world has ever seen.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:25.49,0:16:28.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We can't let a single\None of them get away.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:28.03,0:16:31.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If they stole a ship and slipped\Ninto some country unnoticed,
Dialogue: 50,0:16:31.27,0:16:34.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,there's no telling what sort\Nof terrible things might happen!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:34.44,0:16:37.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Start a count of how many\NLevel 6 prisoners are missing.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:37.71,0:16:41.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Get their names and put out a most\Nwanted list as soon as possible.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:41.25,0:16:42.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BRANNEW gasps]
Dialogue: 50,0:16:43.38,0:16:44.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:44.82,0:16:47.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, uh, actually...
Dialogue: 50,0:16:47.95,0:16:50.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm under direct orders\Nfrom the World Government
Dialogue: 50,0:16:50.42,0:16:53.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,to keep this matter\Na secret at any cost.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:53.12,0:16:53.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:53.86,0:16:58.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A huge blunder like this one could\Nbadly hurt the government's reputation.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:58.66,0:17:00.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[growls]
Dialogue: 50,0:17:03.33,0:17:05.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't give a damn!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:05.07,0:17:06.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SENGOKU'S GOAT bleats]
Dialogue: 50,0:17:32.29,0:17:36.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Doflamingo! You bastard!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:36.89,0:17:38.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[chuckles]
Dialogue: 50,0:17:38.29,0:17:40.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come on! Lighten up!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:40.20,0:17:42.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We both know you're\Ntoo weak to be a Warlord!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:42.83,0:17:43.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just face it!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:43.53,0:17:44.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MORIA growls]
Dialogue: 50,0:17:44.87,0:17:47.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll do you a favor\Nfor old time's sake.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:47.34,0:17:49.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We won't say the government\Nhad you put down,
Dialogue: 50,0:17:49.54,0:17:52.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,we'll say you gave your life in battle.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:52.51,0:17:56.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So, Sengoku put you up to this?\NI'll tear him apart!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:57.01,0:18:00.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nah, think higher up the ladder.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:01.02,0:18:03.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[MORIA gasping]
Dialogue: 50,0:18:22.60,0:18:25.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MARINE AA]\NA pirate ship is approaching\NLascamp in the West Blue!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:25.47,0:18:27.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But we don't have any\Nforces nearby that can help!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:27.87,0:18:30.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Contact the closest base!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:30.24,0:18:33.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Reinforcements from the 80th\Ndivision are on their way!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:35.43,0:18:36.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MARINE BB]\NThis is the South Blue!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:36.70,0:18:38.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Currently checking\Nthe location of the attack!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:38.81,0:18:39.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MARINE B]\NDamn it!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:39.85,0:18:41.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The pirates are supposed\Nto be afraid of us!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:41.68,0:18:43.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Headquarters dealt them\Na major blow at Marineford,
Dialogue: 50,0:18:43.52,0:18:46.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,not to mention Whitebeard\Nis dead, so what gives?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:46.33,0:18:48.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You would've thought they'd\Nbe laying low after the war,
Dialogue: 50,0:18:48.32,0:18:50.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but they're running wild everywhere!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:50.25,0:18:52.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I wonder what's gotten into those guys?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:52.86,0:18:55.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[RADIO VOICE]\NPirates have started raiding Lascamp!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:55.14,0:18:57.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Communication has also been lost!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:57.11,0:18:58.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Proceed to send backup!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:58.41,0:18:59.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I repeat!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:59.21,0:19:01.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Send backup now!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:02.86,0:19:04.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All right boys, load her up!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:04.66,0:19:07.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,After that it's on to the Grand Line!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:07.13,0:19:09.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[cheers]
Dialogue: 50,0:19:12.59,0:19:16.49,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[NARRATOR]\NTwo weeks after the War of the Best\Nconcluded, the world began to witness
Dialogue: 50,0:19:16.49,0:19:19.40,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}the consequences\Nof Whitebeard's defeat.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:23.16,0:19:25.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MAN screams]\NYou guys aren't welcome here!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:25.83,0:19:28.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Get out of our town!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:31.43,0:19:34.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BROWNBEARD PIRATE]\NYou didn't hear the news?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:38.60,0:19:43.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then lemme tell you, this dump's been\Nup for grabs since Whitebeard croaked.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:43.24,0:19:45.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This stupid flag\Ndon't mean a thing now!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:46.51,0:19:47.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:47.48,0:19:50.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's no one to protect you now!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:03.48,0:20:04.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BROWNBEARD chuckles]
Dialogue: 50,0:20:04.75,0:20:06.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:07.62,0:20:08.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, twerp!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:08.72,0:20:11.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Listen up, cause I'm only\Ngonna say this once.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:11.73,0:20:14.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This island's under my control now!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:14.23,0:20:17.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The name's Brownbeard\Nand don't you forget it!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:18.23,0:20:21.00,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[BROWNBEARD laughs]
Dialogue: 50,0:20:21.00,0:20:25.07,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[NARRATOR]\NThe war ended with the death\Nof Whitebeard and a Navy victory.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:25.07,0:20:27.88,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Yet the peace that the World\NGovernment hoped to achieve
Dialogue: 50,0:20:27.88,0:20:32.98,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8\q2}slipped through their fingers and the world\Nwas only plunged into further unrest.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:35.28,0:20:38.79,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Meanwhile, aboard the\NKuja ship Boa Hancock, Jimbei,
Dialogue: 50,0:20:38.79,0:20:42.39,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}and the Heart pirates make\Ntheir way toward Amazon Lily
Dialogue: 50,0:20:42.39,0:20:45.22,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}where they will shelter\Nthe unconscious Luffy.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:48.27,0:20:49.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[IVANKOV]\NNow then.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:49.57,0:20:54.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}This chapter of Straw Boy's life,\Ncostarring yours truly, has come to a close.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:54.04,0:20:55.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Heehaw!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:55.54,0:20:59.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Jimbei, I hope you don't mind\Nwatching over our friend in my place.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:59.52,0:21:00.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:00.45,0:21:03.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My body is still too weak to swim,\Nbut the least that I can do
Dialogue: 50,0:21:03.79,0:21:07.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,is watch over Luffy until he recovers.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:07.16,0:21:11.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Though, I fear there is precious\Nlittle aid I can give him.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:11.99,0:21:15.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It was a curious twist of\Nfate to meet you, fishman.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:15.00,0:21:15.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Likewise.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:15.90,0:21:19.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Although we were both imprisoned\Nin the lowest levels of Impel Down,
Dialogue: 50,0:21:19.20,0:21:21.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,our paths nearly didn't cross.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:21.64,0:21:24.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy carried us away\Nlike a tidal wave.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:24.31,0:21:28.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Though I must admit, I know not\Nthe direction that these seas flow.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:29.17,0:21:30.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[IVANKOV]\NTidal wave is right.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:30.72,0:21:35.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,His antics at Marineford were\Ntoo turbulent even for us.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:35.89,0:21:39.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I hate to say goodbye, my friend,\Nbut the candy boys and girls of my kingdom
Dialogue: 50,0:21:39.99,0:21:43.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,can only wait on\Ntheir master for so long!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:43.13,0:21:45.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do take good care of Straw Boy for me!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:45.40,0:21:47.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I shall miss him!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:51.44,0:21:54.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So long! Bye! Thanks\Nfor everything, Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:54.61,0:21:58.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll tell tales of you in\NKamabakka Kingdom for years to come!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:58.54,0:22:01.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,When he wakes up,\Nbe sure to say "hi" for us!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:01.11,0:22:02.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[IVANKOV]\NGet well soon, Straw Boy!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:02.85,0:22:04.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We can't wait to see you again!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:04.42,0:22:05.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BUNNY QUEER]\NHang in there!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:05.62,0:22:08.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CHAUFFEUR QUEER]\NEverything's gonna be okay!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:08.82,0:22:10.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's go, my darlings!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:10.91,0:22:13.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah! Off to the New Kama paradise!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:13.58,0:22:15.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Keep leading the way, Queen Iva!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:15.82,0:22:16.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yessir!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:16.62,0:22:19.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Peachy Island, here we come!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:19.59,0:22:23.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I hate to ruin the moment, but we\Nreally should be on our way now.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:25.99,0:22:27.29,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[NARRATOR]\NTwo weeks have passed.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:27.29,0:22:30.76,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Law and his crew are staying\Nin the bay, continuing to treat
Dialogue: 50,0:22:30.76,0:22:33.56,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Luffy's injuries without\Nencroaching on the island.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:50.26,0:22:53.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What will happen to him\Nif he remains in that state?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:53.26,0:22:54.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Simple.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:54.36,0:22:59.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If he keeps flailing around,\Nthe more likely he is to open his wound,
Dialogue: 50,0:22:59.00,0:23:02.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and if that happens,\Nchances are he'll die.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:05.37,0:23:07.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PIRATE FF]\NQuick! Now's our chance!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:07.47,0:23:09.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NDamn it, get off me!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:09.01,0:23:10.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PIRATE GG]\NJust hold still!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:10.89,0:23:11.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NShut up!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:11.59,0:23:12.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NLet me go!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:13.65,0:23:15.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[screams]
Dialogue: 50,0:23:15.19,0:23:17.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where did they take you?
Dialogue: 50,0:23:17.56,0:23:19.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where'd you go?
Dialogue: 50,0:23:19.93,0:23:22.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[AMAZON C]\NHe's gone completely mad!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:22.20,0:23:23.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, Luffy.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:23.53,0:23:26.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We've got to tell the Snake Princess!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:26.23,0:23:27.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[AMAZON 491E]\NPrincess!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:27.10,0:23:28.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We have big news!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:28.56,0:23:30.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you there?
Dialogue: 50,0:23:30.93,0:23:32.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[AMAZON 491E]\NLuffy has finally woken up!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:32.83,0:23:33.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy is awake?
Dialogue: 50,0:23:33.93,0:23:34.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 50,0:23:34.67,0:23:36.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, thank goodness.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:36.14,0:23:38.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I must rush to his side immediately.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:38.50,0:23:40.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[NYON]\NYou cannyot!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:40.50,0:23:43.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The kingdom is obsessed\Nwith seeing those men.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:43.17,0:23:48.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How can you expect them to follow our laws\Nif you so readily break them yourself?
Dialogue: 50,0:23:48.24,0:23:51.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Men are prohibited in our land.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:51.02,0:23:56.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Luffy is one thing, but I cringe at how\Neasily we let these strangers into the bay!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:56.20,0:23:59.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Must you keep bending the rules?
Dialogue: 50,0:23:59.27,0:24:01.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes, I know, but he needs help.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:01.04,0:24:03.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Before worrying about that,\Nyou should eat something.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:03.59,0:24:04.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Your sister's right!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:04.80,0:24:08.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Since you returned to Amazon Lily,\Nyou've barely eaten a bite!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:08.54,0:24:09.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Food! Yes!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:09.57,0:24:11.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy must be starving\Nafter his recovery!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:11.74,0:24:12.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He will need his strength!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:12.90,0:24:15.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Go prepare a mountain\Nof dishes rich in nutrients!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:15.44,0:24:17.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes! As you wish!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:17.07,0:24:18.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And I shall aid you, myself.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:18.77,0:24:20.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Onward to the kitchen!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:20.22,0:24:21.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,For Luffy!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:23.33,0:24:25.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can let this one pass.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:25.23,0:24:27.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So she wants to do some cooking.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:27.40,0:24:28.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nyo harm in that.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:28.77,0:24:31.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,When we're done, I'll serve him myself!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:31.57,0:24:33.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you even listening?
Dialogue: 50,0:24:33.67,0:24:38.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,When he gets well, we'll invite\NLuffy to these chambers alone.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:40.59,0:24:41.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[HANCOCK]\NWhat nonsense!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:41.76,0:24:42.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I am an empress!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:42.86,0:24:44.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You can't tell me what to do!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:44.29,0:24:45.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[NYON]\NNyo means nyo!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:45.63,0:24:49.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The well being of this country\Ndoes not revolve around you!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:49.43,0:24:50.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You poor girl!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:50.78,0:24:54.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You've been stricken by the\Nmost vile illness imaginable.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:54.19,0:24:58.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,To think that our fearsome pirate\Nempress is lovesick, of all things!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:58.93,0:25:03.46,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy must have gone through hell\Nand back surviving both Impel Down
Dialogue: 50,0:25:03.46,0:25:06.83,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,and the terrible things that\Nhappened at Navy Headquarters.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:06.83,0:25:09.80,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Despite my protests,\Nthe fact that he made it back
Dialogue: 50,0:25:09.80,0:25:13.01,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,here alive is nyothing\Nshort of a miracle.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:13.01,0:25:17.21,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't help but wonder\Nwhat the gods expect of him.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:18.38,0:25:19.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PIRATE II]\NYo pass me the wrench.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:19.81,0:25:21.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PIRATE JJ]\N'Kay, here ya go.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:21.73,0:25:24.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! How're the ship\Nrepairs coming along?
Dialogue: 50,0:25:24.60,0:25:26.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll manage don't you worry.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:26.34,0:25:28.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The rest of you ever figure out\Nwhere Straw Hat went?
Dialogue: 50,0:25:28.58,0:25:30.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Jimbei's been gone\Nfor a while now, too.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:30.49,0:25:33.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nope. Ain't got a clue.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:33.86,0:25:36.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PENGUIN]\NSomeone told me that\Nif a man enters Amazon Lily,
Dialogue: 50,0:25:36.89,0:25:39.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,he'll be turned to\Nstone right on the spot.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:39.39,0:25:41.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm starting to think it's\Nworth dying for, though.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:41.83,0:25:44.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SHACHI]\NAccording to Aphelandra,\Nthere're tons of girls.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:44.86,0:25:47.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Way more than what we saw at the port.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:47.36,0:25:49.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is a one time chance.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:49.14,0:25:52.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If I don't peek, I might regret\Nit for the rest of my life!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:52.17,0:25:54.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I guess we'll both\Nbe statues, then, huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:25:54.31,0:25:56.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do you think they've got girl bears?
Dialogue: 50,0:25:56.43,0:25:58.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're ruining our fantasy!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:58.20,0:25:59.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BEPO]\NSorry I asked.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:59.50,0:26:01.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Amazon women are humans!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:01.34,0:26:02.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No bears for you!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:02.64,0:26:04.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BEPO]\NLife is cruel!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:40.66,0:26:42.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What is this place?
Dialogue: 50,0:26:42.06,0:26:45.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where am I?
Dialogue: 50,0:26:45.20,0:26:46.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Maybe.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:46.57,0:26:48.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I dreamt the whole thing.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:00.28,0:27:03.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[screams]
Dialogue: 50,0:27:03.15,0:27:05.35,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Luffy.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:05.35,0:27:06.72,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,I tried.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:11.29,0:27:14.93,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,[ACE]\NLooks like this is as far as I can go.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:24.27,0:27:25.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NIt's not true!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:25.57,0:27:27.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It can't be!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:27.49,0:27:28.86,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,[ACE]\NLuffy!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:30.13,0:27:33.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Go away!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:39.72,0:27:40.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NStop it!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:40.78,0:27:43.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's not true!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:43.35,0:27:49.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[roars]
Dialogue: 50,0:28:21.32,0:28:22.38,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,[ACE]\NJimbei.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:22.38,0:28:25.45,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,I know I might not\Nmake it out of this alive.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:25.45,0:28:29.76,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but if I die, would\Nyou look after my brother for me?
Dialogue: 50,0:28:32.26,0:28:35.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You must listen to me, Luffy!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:35.00,0:28:36.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Your brother Ace is...
Dialogue: 50,0:28:36.70,0:28:37.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NDon't say it!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:37.83,0:28:40.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't say anything!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:41.17,0:28:43.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You think I don't know?
Dialogue: 50,0:28:43.54,0:28:46.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You think I think this is a dream?
Dialogue: 50,0:28:47.58,0:28:53.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NIf it were a dream,\NI'd already be awake!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:53.95,0:28:56.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But it's not, is it?
Dialogue: 50,0:29:04.89,0:29:08.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My brother Ace is\Nreally dead, isn't he?
Dialogue: 50,0:29:15.60,0:29:18.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[JIMBEI]\NYes, I'm afraid that he is.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:18.33,0:29:26.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY sobs]
Dialogue: 50,0:29:26.43,0:29:27.73,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NHey, Grandpa!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:27.73,0:29:29.77,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Who's this Ace fella?
Dialogue: 50,0:29:29.77,0:29:33.14,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,[GARP]\NWell, funny you should ask...
Dialogue: 50,0:29:33.14,0:29:36.31,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,'cause Ace is gonna\Nbe your new big brother!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:38.24,0:29:43.38,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,[ACE]\NLuffy, when next we meet,\Nwe'll both be top pirates!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:43.38,0:29:44.32,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,The top.
